Package: polished
Title: Download and Clean WHO POLIS Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Mohamed A.",
           family = "Yusuf",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mohamedayusuf87@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9339-4613"))
Description: Retrieves and cleans poliovirus surveillance data from the
    World Health Organization Polio Information System ('POLIS') API.
    Pulls POLIS tables into a local cache as 'raw_*' files, working around
    the API's Id-range pagination and year-aligned date filters with
    checkpointed, parallel, resumable fetching. An end-to-end pipeline then
    cleans those inputs into analysis-ready 'polished_*' tables, with
    optional surveillance indicators and data-quality checks.
